  <section id="codegen" class="doc-section">
    <h2>Codegen</h2>
    <p>
      Public functions in <code>packages/httpapi-codegen</code> are <code>compile</code>,
      <code>emitEffect</code>, <code>emitEffectImported</code>, <code>emitEffectShape</code>,
      <code>emitPromise</code>, <code>emitPromiseCompat</code>, <code>write</code>, and
      <code>generate</code>.
    </p>
    <p>
      <code>packages/api/scripts/generate-clients.ts</code> calls <code>compile</code> on
      <code>Api</code> with <code>clientPathsFromEndpointNames: true</code> and
      <code>clientMiddleware</code> set to <code>cadcamfun/api/Authorization</code>.
      <code>emitPromise</code> writes <code>packages/api/src/sdk/generated</code>.
      <code>emitEffectImported</code> writes <code>packages/api/src/client/generated</code>.
      The scripts are <code>bun run generate</code> and <code>generate:check</code>.
    </p>
